OL,3,GNEWSAWarning over car park charity
OL,4,Acollector scam
OL,5,
OL,6,FA scam warning has been issued by
OL,7,Fpolice after a couple who tried to
OL,8,Fsupport a charity had "a significant
OL,9,Famount" taken from their account.
OL,11,FA young woman approached a couple in a
OL,12,Fcar park in Lutterworth on Sunday,
OL,13,FLeicestershire Police said.
OL,15,FPCSO Steve Adams said she was "well
OL,16,Fdressed" but was only communicating
OL,17,Fusing sign language and a clipboard. He
OL,18,Fadded she was gathering donations using
OL,19,Fa card reader for a charity supporting
OL,20,Fwomen and children.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
