OL,3,GNEWSAWarning over car park charity
OL,4,Acollector scam
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe couple tried to donate #5, which
OL,7,Fdid not go through the first time, but
OL,8,Fafter trying a second time, they later
OL,9,Frealised a much larger sum of money had
OL,10,Fbeen taken from their bank, the force
OL,11,Fadded.
